{
  "title": "Wyoming Commercial Property Tax Transparency Survey",
  "description": "A statewide Wyoming survey on commercial property valuation, mill levies, assessment notices, business personal property, and taxpayer review and appeal rights, using Natrona County and Casper as a case study.",
  "completedHtml": "<p>Thank you. Your response has been recorded.</p>",
  "showQuestionNumbers": "on",
  "questionTitleLocation": "top",
  "questionErrorLocation": "bottom",
  "goNextPageAutomatic": false,
  "showProgressBar": "off",
  "completeText": "Submit survey",
  "x_meta": {
    "flow": "sectioned",
    "sectionExitEnabled": true,
    "sectionExitLabel": "End of section",
    "exitUrl": "/surveys/list/",
    "path": "normal-life",
    "category_slug": "commercial-property-tax",
    "estimated_minutes": 8,
    "featured": true
  },
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "intro",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "intro_overview",
          "html": "<h3>Purpose</h3><p>This is a statewide Wyoming survey. Responses will be counted by county. Natrona County and Casper are being used as the starting case study because public records, valuation notices, mill levy information, commercial property guidance, and review procedures are available for public discussion.</p><p>The purpose is to understand whether citizens want clearer, more consistent, and more accountable commercial property tax information across Wyoming.</p><p><a class=\"button button--small button--secondary\" href=\"/assets/wyoming_commercial_property_tax_sources.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Review the source packet</a></p><h3>How responses will be used</h3><ul><li>Results will be published in aggregate, reported by county.</li><li>Exact question wording and answer choices will be published with the results.</li><li>Individual responses will remain confidential.</li></ul>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "section_1_county_connection",
      "title": "Section 1: County and connection",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "s1_header",
          "html": "<h3>Section 1: County and connection</h3>"
        },
        {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "name": "q1_county",
          "title": "1. Which Wyoming county should your response be counted in?",
          "choices": [
            "Albany",
            "Big Horn",
            "Campbell",
            "Carbon",
            "Converse",
            "Crook",
            "Fremont",
            "Goshen",
            "Hot Springs",
            "Johnson",
            "Laramie",
            "Lincoln",
            "Natrona",
            "Niobrara",
            "Park",
            "Platte",
            "Sheridan",
            "Sublette",
            "Sweetwater",
            "Teton",
            "Uinta",
            "Washakie",
            "Weston"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "html",
          "name": "q1_source_link",
          "html": "<p class=\"survey-source-link\"><a href=\"/assets/wyoming_commercial_property_tax_sources.pdf#page=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Why county-level responses matter</a></p>"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "name": "q2_connection",
          "title": "2. What is your connection to this issue? Select all that apply.",
          "choices": [
            "I own commercial property",
            "I lease commercial space",
            "I own or operate a business",
            "I work for a business affected by rent or property costs",
            "I own residential property",
            "I rent my home",
            "I am concerned as a taxpayer",
            "I work in real estate, appraisal, finance, or property management",
            "I serve or have served in local government"
          ],
          "hasOther": true,
          "otherText": "Other"
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "q3_direct_experience",
          "title": "3. Is your answer based on direct experience with commercial property taxes?",
          "choices": [
            "Yes",
            "No",
            "Somewhat",
            "I am learning about the issue"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "section_2_basic_understanding",
      "title": "Section 2: Basic understanding",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "html",
