          "html": "<h3>Section 2: Basic understanding</h3>"
        },
        {
          "type": "radiogroup",
          "name": "q4_understanding_calculation",
          "title": "4. Before this survey, how well did you understand how Wyoming commercial property taxes are calculated?",
          "choices": [
